Third-Party Runtime Notice (Remotion)

This plugin package itself contains zero bundled Remotion code and is licensed
under the MIT License above. When you trigger local MP4 video export for the
first time, the plugin installs `remotion`, `@remotion/bundler`, and
`@remotion/renderer` into `~/.dsh/reel-desk/runtime/`.

Remotion is governed by the Remotion License:
- Free for individuals and organizations/companies with up to 3 people.
- Companies or organizations with 4 or more people require a paid Remotion
  Company License.
See https://www.remotion.dev/docs/license/faq and
https://github.com/remotion-dev/remotion/blob/main/LICENSE.md for full terms.
